  "name": "Question 2",
  "problem": "What is $(\\sqrt{7})^{2}?$",
  "worked_solution": "The number in the square root is non-negative, so the square and the square root cancel each other out.\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n(\\sqrt{7})^{2}=7.\n$$",
